  "bodyHash": "owhljGhr+Bw=",
  "content": "<p>為Epic Fight Mod新增 32 個被動技能。當閃避成功或格擋成功時，玩家將獲得增益效果。</p><p>每種效果皆有 4 個等級的技能書。</p><p>在完美閃避或完美格擋後，您可能獲得以下效果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>立即恢復生命值</li>\n<li>瞬間治療</li>\n<li>生命提升</li>\n<li>傷害吸收</li>\n<li>抗性</li>\n<li>暈眩免疫</li>\n<li>力量</li>\n<li>速度</li>\n<li>體力提升</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_78f5e408-de1c-4932-8471-a302d7ae8a32.png\" width=\"403\" height=\"204\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304607/description_df7fe0af-2cb5-4c81-992d-ddf37c3281c6.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>新增預設技能樹。（需安裝Epic Skill Tree模組）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304607/description_1f68fec1-8093-433c-80c8-56d3e87da003.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您可以使用資料包來修改持續時間、效果等級、環境效果、可見度以及顯示圖示。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304607/description_039d44f8-3b20-477f-91f8-af5675836086.png\" width=\"265\" height=\"107\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1304607/description_ba37ee65-3af0-4926-9c0f-44a6c5251ae3.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"233\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
